Package: onnxruntime-ep-vulkan
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1,
         libonnxruntime-tts (>= 1.32.0)
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd
Description: Vulkan execution provider plugin for ONNX Runtime
 onnx-vulkan-rs runs ONNX models on any graphics card with a Vulkan
 driver (AMD, Intel, NVIDIA), through compute shaders. This package has
 its plugin execution provider for the private onnxruntime of
 libonnxruntime-tts, in /usr/lib/<triplet>/linux-tts; sherpa-onnx of the
 linux-tts PPA loads it for the provider "vulkan".
 .
 The project is young (2026, one author); it supports the operators of
 the Piper, MMS and Supertonic voices, others fall back to the CPU.
